60)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Michal Hlavinka &lt;mhlavink@redhat.com&gt; - 1:2.3.16-13" date="1722859201">- rebuild with updated tests</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Michal Hlavinka &lt;mhlavink@redhat.com&gt; - 1:2.3.16-14" date="1724155200">- fix CVE-2024-23184: using a large number of address headers may trigger a denial of service (RHEL-55212)\n- fix CVE-2024-23185: very large headers can cause resource exhaustion when parsing message (RHEL-55224)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Michal Hlavinka &lt;mhlavink@redhat.com&gt; - 1:2.3.16-15" date="1738756800">- fix sysusers config file name (RHEL-77322)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Michal Hlavinka &lt;mhlavink@redhat.com&gt; - 1:2.3.16-16" date="1768219200">- add /var/lib/dovecot to tmpfiles for image mode (RHEL-139098)\n- fix building with latest openssl (RHEL-140619)</changelog>\n</package>\n')
